## Contents and privacy

The bundle holds no rows of your dataset. The parity fixture is synthetic: numeric values are
drawn between the 5th and 95th percentiles, and categories are ones the fitted encoders already
store inside `model.joblib`. Every file's SHA-256 is listed in `manifest.json`.
